            <note corresp="#d76-f6" n="6" xml:id="d76-f6-content">
                <p>Vaky wrote “by the Chileans” at the end
                    of the sentence. Below it he wrote, “I am working on a ‘reining in’
                    instruction.”</p>
            </note>
